  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you open the main menu while in a seated in a station that is rotating, the main menu will become skewed. This can sometimes result in the menu facing away from the player which makes it unusable since none of the UI elements can be clicked on from behind. The issue persists between worlds/instances so the only way to fix this is to close and restart VRChat.\n\nExample world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_66bcd961-0660-4dca-a99f-2887d9112ff2\n\nThe world contains a spinning seat. Sit on it and then open the main menu (much easier done if you have the setting to open the main menu by double tapping the button).\n\nAdditionally, this seems to be a VR-specific bug as I wasn't able to replicate this in non-VR platforms.",
